; Windows' dinput8.dll exports (x86, from Windows 11 build 26300), with their ordinals.
; Ordinal-only exports get a made-up name (tuft_proxy_ordinal_N) that isn't exported.
EXPORTS
    DirectInput8Create @1
    DllCanUnloadNow @2
    DllGetClassObject @3
    DllRegisterServer @4
    DllUnregisterServer @5
    GetdfDIJoystick @6
